# Set exactly one credential below. The process exits at startup if none
# are configured. Never commit your real key; copy this file to .env and
# fill it in for local development (or set it directly in your agent's MCP
# config).

# TypeSafe direct (default when set). https://docs.typesafe.ai/api
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter's alpha Decisions endpoint, as an alternative to TypeSafe direct.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Vercel AI Gateway, as another alternative to TypeSafe direct.
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Force a specific backend instead of auto-detecting from the keys above.
# One of: typesafe | openrouter | vercel
# JEV_BACKEND=

# Already using one of the default var names above for something else?
# Redirect that backend to read its key from a different variable instead,
# e.g.:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY_ENV=MY_JEV_OPENROUTER_KEY
# MY_JEV_OPENROUTER_KEY=
# (also available as TYPESAFE_API_KEY_ENV / AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY_ENV)
